       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTARCH.
      *****************************************************************
      * CALLS THE IO MODULE THE WAY MOST SHOPS DO - BY MOVING THE      *
      * PROGRAM NAME INTO A VARIABLE AND CALLING THE VARIABLE. THE     *
      * WIDENED NAME REACHES CUST_ARCHIVE ONLY IF THAT INDIRECTION IS  *
      * RESOLVED.                                                      *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE CUSTOMER END-EXEC.
       01  WS-PGM-NAME              PIC X(08).
       01  WS-ARCH-NAME             PIC X(30).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT CUST_NAME
                 INTO :CUST-NAME
                 FROM CUSTOMER
                WHERE CUST_ID = :CUST-ID
           END-EXEC
           MOVE CUST-NAME TO WS-ARCH-NAME
           MOVE 'IOCUSTNM' TO WS-PGM-NAME
           CALL WS-PGM-NAME USING WS-ARCH-NAME
           GOBACK.
